<h1>🎬 Galaxy Defense Pathfinder Creator Program — Launch Kit</h1>

<div class="section">
<h2>1. Discord 公告（置顶 @everyone）</h2>
<p><b>频道</b>: #📢-announcements<br><b>发送时间</b>: 周五晚 8PM（玩家活跃高峰）</p>
<pre>🎬 **Galaxy Defense Pathfinder Creator Program is NOW LIVE!**

Create YouTube &amp; TikTok videos about Galaxy Defense and earn REAL rewards — diamonds, in-game items, and exclusive perks!

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

💎 **HOW IT WORKS**

1️⃣ Sign up → Get your creator account
2️⃣ Create a video with #galaxydefense #galaxydefensepathfinder
3️⃣ Submit on our website → Sync views → Claim rewards!

🆓 **Zero cost to start** — use your phone's built-in screen recorder and free editing tools. We have a step-by-step guide showing you exactly how.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

🏆 **REWARDS**

**Milestone Rewards** (per campaign, YT + TT combined views):
300 views → 300 💎
600 views → 600 💎
1,000 views → 1,000 💎
3,000 views → 2,000 💎
6,000 views → 3,000 💎
10,000 views → 5,000 💎
30,000 views → 7,000 💎
50,000 views → 9,000 💎
80,000 views → 12,000 💎
100,000 views → 15,000 💎
150,000 views → 20,000 💎
200,000 views → 30,000 💎

**5 Special Bonuses:**
📝 Registration Bonus — 200 💎 just for signing up
☀️ Participation Award — 500 💎 for your first video
💪 Diligence Award — 1,000 💎 for 15+ active days
⭐ Star Creator Award — 1,000 💎 for 5K+ followers
🤖 AI Comic Award — 500 💎 per AI-generated story video

Choose 💎 Diamonds (sent to your game account) or 🪙 Points (spend in our Reward Shop)!

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

📖 **Starter Guide** (free tutorials, topic ideas, sample videos):
https://creator-reward-platform.vercel.app/guide

✍️ **Sign Up** (takes 1 minute):
[Google Form Link]

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

❓ Questions? Ask @Hedy in our Discord: https://discord.gg/8tcRJ7wwDB</pre>
