<h2>3. 面向现有玩家的邮件</h2>
<p><b>Subject</b>: 🎬 Create Galaxy Defense Videos &amp; Earn Rewards!</p>
<pre>Hi Commander,

The Galaxy Defense Pathfinder Creator Program is now live!

Want to earn free diamonds, in-game items, and exclusive rewards? All you need is your phone — record gameplay, post to YouTube or TikTok, and submit to our platform. Zero cost, zero experience needed.

🎯 HOW TO JOIN:
1. Sign up here: [Google Form Link]
2. Check your email for your creator account credentials
3. Read our free guide: https://creator-reward-platform.vercel.app/guide
4. Create your first video with #galaxydefense #galaxydefensepathfinder
5. Submit on our site and start earning!

💎 REWARDS SCALE FROM 300 → 30,000 DIAMONDS
🆓 ALL TOOLS MENTIONED IN GUIDE ARE 100% FREE

Questions? Join our Discord and ask @Hedy:
https://discord.gg/8tcRJ7wwDB

See you on the battlefield, Commander! 🚀</pre>
